From 1a797c2d56c0ddac6d9f071dc9486846cb43c1d1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jakub Jelen <jjelen@redhat.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 10:38:42 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Update the upstream signing key

Replace nettle-release-keyring.gpg with nettle-release-keyring.asc, the
key upstream publishes at
https://keys.openpgp.org/vks/v1/by-fingerprint/343C2FF0FBEE5EC2EDBEF399F3599FF828C67298#/nettle-release-keyring.asc
(byte for byte); its Source line is now that URL.

The current key is needed to verify the release signature with
openpgpverify (sqv), which checks that the key was valid when the
release was signed.

Assisted-by: Claude Opus 5.5
---
 .gitignore                 |  1 -
 mingw-nettle.spec          |  2 +-
 nettle-release-keyring.asc | 91 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 sources                    |  1 -
 4 files changed, 92 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 nettle-release-keyring.asc

diff --git a/.gitignore b/.gitignore
index ee75e9e..a589309 100644
--- a/.gitignore
+++ b/.gitignore
@@ -1,3 +1,2 @@
 /nettle-*.tar.gz
 /nettle-*.tar.gz.sig
-/nettle-release-keyring.gpg
